Retired 2026-07-27. Last used 2026-03-17; daily-report covers the reflection
side and this aggregate weekly view stopped being used.

The collection assets this skill used to own (scripts/*.jq, references/schemas.md)
now live under daily-report/, and the activity-reporter agent points there — both
skills always shared them, so daily-report would break if they stayed here.

To bring this skill back: delete this file and re-run sync-links.sh. The assets
stay where they are; nothing needs moving back.
